<title>OMAN: OMAN AND EMIRATES INVESTMENT H1 NET SOARS.</title>
<headline>OMAN AND EMIRATES INVESTMENT H1 NET SOARS.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman and Emirates Investment posted first half 1997 net profit of 3.4 million rials ($9 million), up from 912,999 rials in the year-ago period, the official Oman News Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>Total income in the period soared to 4.1 million rials compared with 1.3 million rials in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>Expenses reached 639,376 rials compared with 369,092 a year earlier, the agency said.</p>
<p>($1=0.377 rials)</p>
</text>
